    "long_instructions": "#Wireframe Partner\r\n\r\nUse AI chat as a thinking partner to help plan your wireframes.\r\n\r\nYou can ask for help with:\r\n- brainstorming page ideas for your web app\r\n- deciding what sections or components should go on each page\r\n- checking if your pages connect clearly for a user\r\n\r\nTips for working with AI:\r\n- Describe your app idea clearly\r\n- Ask for suggestions, not full designs\r\n- Only keep ideas that make sense for your app",
